<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/09f8202b239c22778618bbee9dd67b760594c4030c3c7dede5e9514e73b1582e> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Summary"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The head and shoulders of a female figure (a goddess?), facing right"@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/09fc0965129d62609e54b03117a6a8c207f2ae534a2393da5f487d880b4a4a39> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P><hi rend="head">Side A:</hi> Herakles killing the
      Nemean lion, thrusting his sword into the lion's chest. To his left watches a youth wearing a
      chiton and a mantle decorated with flowers, as well as a woman dressed in a chiton and a
      peplos. She also wears earrings and a necklace. The spectators to the right include a bearded
      older man, dressed similarly to the youth on the left, and a hoplite. A few details are
      rendered in white, such as the woman's skin, the lion's teeth, the handle of the sword, and
      the lower edge of the hoplite's helmet. The majority of the details are painted in
      red.</P><P><hi rend="head">Side B:</hi> The central figure is a woman
      wearing a peplos and a hooded mantle drawn over the back of her head. She is flanked by two
      youths dressed in a chiton and a mantle with floral decoration. The group is framed by two
      hoplites. Their shield devices consist of three lines, an eye, and a pentagram. White paint
      marks the woman's skin, the shield devices, and the crests of the helmets. As in the other
      panel, the remaining details are rendered in red.</P><P>Above the panels runs a
      frieze of pendant lotus buds. Red lines decorate the rim, neck and foot of the amphora. Rays
      set off in white paint extend from the foot.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/09fd943e0bc529305d8f1138d60c11ac8c73ce307b1c564ee2b69b2c7aea0210> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Summary"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Sides A and B: siren between two draped youths."@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/0a074d870bcc47ab4d5fe44aae9f1ce0026668d0fc383be7ba42401c29776957> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
