<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/111c6a3822d70263f453c24f9ce7efa7166d9d683385b57370ed059376c54965> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Bibliographic references"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "<bibl>Lewes 1920</bibl>, no. 37" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026497> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/1120ecbeecbec53f57d3fc2a5b8cf852ed2d0c6e7dfe8379a53f33b5bd550778> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P><hi rend="ital">Side A:</hi> At center a male
      figure stands, facing right and carrying a spear in his left hand. He is bearded with long
      hair and wears a fillet, long chiton in added red, and a himation embroidered with white
      rosettes. In front of him is a bearded male figure running to the right and looking back to
      the left. He holds up a wreath in his right hand to the first figure and grasps a spear in his
      left. His long hair is bound with a fillet and tied back. He wears a chlamys embroidered with
      white rosettes. A similar male figure stands to the extreme left. On the right is a bearded
      male figure facing left and holding a spear in his right hand and a wreath in his left. He has
      long hair confined in a beaded fillet and wears a long chiton in added red and a himation
      embroidered with white rosettes.</P><P><hi rend="ital">Side B:</hi>
      Similar scene. At center a male figure stands, facing right and carrying a spear in his left
      hand. He is bearded with long hair and wears a fillet, long chiton with dots in added red, and
      an embroidered himation. Behind him is a bearded male figure facing right with a staff in his
      right hand and his left raised. His long hair is bound with a beaded fillet and he wears a
      long chiton in added red and an embroidered himation. In front of the first figure is a
      beardless male figure advancing to the right, but looking back to the left with his right hand
      raised. He wears his long hair tied back and confined with a fillet and an embroidered
      chlamys. On the right is a bearded male standing to the left and holding a spear in his right
      hand and a wreath in his left. He has long hair confined in a fillet and wears a long chiton
      in added red and an embroidered himation.</P><P>Over the design panel is a frieze
      of lotus buds. 'Affected' style.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/112f0323ff3919c0c52be25317407fb92eda2eceefca89cae384f96e7c09e36d> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Bibliographic references"@en ;
