      (A. Comotti), fig. 356; <bibl>Stella 1956</bibl>, 750; Ghali-Kahil 1955, 90-91 no.
      72 pl. 66.1-3; <bibl>Rumpf 1953</bibl>, pl. 34.4; <bibl>Dugas
      1930</bibl>, fig. 16; E. Lwy, Polygnot (Vienna 1929) pl. 21; <bibl>FR</bibl>
      3.307, pl. 170; <hi rend="ital">CIG</hi> 8411; J. Overbeck, Gallerie heroischer
