    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Broken and repaired, with restoration and repainting in the cracks and gaps.
      Reserved areas, including parts of several figures, are damaged by pitting and erosion. Much
      of the neck on both sides is lost, including a large part of the lotus buds. Rim
      chipped.</P>""" ;
