    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/1a56d12fbb4c4129cbfb1bf1fe540be3b5997ced39197c29b87f5bebec7a5002> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Bibliographic references"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "<bibl>Richter 1984, 109-11, fig. 73</bibl>" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026497> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/1a6ced8e8b6c0a2b953890af430988e327267757f8de5871b0553aa35688b864> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Judgement of Paris around the entire vessel. <hi
      rend="ital">Side A</hi>: Hermes, with travel hat, winged shoes and <hi
      rend="ital">kerykeion</hi>, leads Hera and Athena to Paris. Paris is bearded, dressed
      in short chiton, sitting on a stool and carries a large lyre in his left hand and the plektron
      in his right. Hera is a tall figure wrapped in a himation and resembling an archaic kore
      sculpture. Athena is also dressed in chiton and himation, and carries a spear; her head is
      missing.</P><P>Side B: Aphrodite, a woman and two youths. The female figure on the
      left is probably Aphrodite, belonging to the Judgement of Paris scene on the opposite side;
      she faces to the left rather than towards the center of this scene. She is dressed like a
      normal mortal woman, wrapped in a himation and looking, as does Hera, like an archaic
      sculpture. To the right, a veiled woman between two youths draped in mantles is holding a love
      wreath. Behind her a veiled woman offering a love wreath to a men at her left. Behind her
      another youth facing left.</P><P>This is another variation of the representation
      of the Judgement of Paris, in which Paris does not come to meet the divine procession, but is
      surprised while seated doing something, as here playing the lyre. The archaic sources for this
      event are <bibl n="Hom. Il. 24.25-30">Hom. Il. 24.25-30</bibl> and <bibl
      n="Cypr. (EGF 17)">Cypr. (EGF 17)</bibl>.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/1a70fff849c1cee5486acc196cef76a8b0ec7e5cce0876d100773a1e2c125a34> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Bibliographic references"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P><bibl>CVA, USA fasc. 20, p. 10, pl.
      80</bibl></P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026497> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/1a7a416911a91fee19494e85b9c7b4daf1d523d813f120f61bc0a2c2c9cb61ba> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Bibliographic references"@en ;
