      rend="ital">AJA</hi> 66 (1962): 229-232.</bibl>; <bibl>CVA, Great Britain
      1, British Museum 1, 1926, 5</bibl>.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026497> .

