    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "<bibl><hi rend=\"ital\">BMC</hi></bibl> Sicily, 48, no. 35; McFadden, E. J., <hi rend=\"ital\">Minerva</hi> 8 (1997) 58, illus." ;
