<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/2c59a516ee68a6c481fbe7a1b0827db5beb4b4de85452bb54098eda3ab728451> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """Middle (white ground): A column denoting interior space; nude Achilles
      (labelled), seated profile to the right in a klismos, with his right knee crossed over his
      left knee, his hands clasped in his lap, and his head bowed, in front of a kline on which lies
      Patroklos (labelled), lying profile to the left, with his head tilted up and his eyes closed,
      wrapped in a shroud, wearing a white taenia; a thin cloth hangs in front of him; another
      column; Klymene (labelled), seated on a dolphin 3/4-view to the left, with her head turned
      profile to the right, and her legs crossed, wearing a himation around her legs, over a
      medium-sleeved, belted chiton with an overfold, a brown band necklace, a brown dot earring,
      two bands on each wrist, a high pony tail tied in a pink band, holds a sword (in a scabbard)
      upright in her upraised right hand, and reaches her left hand, beseeching (?), toward Psamathe
      (labelled) (most of her left arm missing) seated 3/4-view to the left on a dolphin, with her
      head turned 3/4-view to the right, wearing a himation around her legs, over a medium-sleeved,
      belted chiton, with an overfold, a white taenia, two bands on each wrist, a beaded necklace,
      bead earrings, holds a helmet, profile to the right, in her upraised right hand, and holds her
      left hand in front of her mouth (in a speaking gesture?); Thetis (labelled) seated 3/4-view to
      the left, on a dolphin, with her legs crossed, wearing a himation around her lower body, over
      a short-sleeved, belted chiton, a rayed taenia, a single band necklace, a disk earring, a
      snake band on her right wrist, a diagonal spear and a frontal shield (decorated in relief,
      with a lion sema prancing profile to the left) on her left arm, her right hand above her knee,
      on a dolphin; a Nereid seated 3/4-view to the left on a dolphin (head and parts of body
      missing), wearing a himation around her lower body, over her left shoulder, and a
      short-sleeved chiton, holds a cuirass (?) and reins with both hands; a Nereid (some of the top
      of her head, and her body below her waist are preserved) seated 3/4-view to the left on a
      dolphin, wearing a himation around her lower body, over a belted, medium-sleeved chiton, and a
      pink snake bracelet on her right hand, holds her left hand on her knee, and a greave in her
      right hand; Galene (labelled) (missing the middle of her body), seated profile to the left on
      a dolphin, wearing a short-sleeved, belted chiton (with shoulder straps?), a dot earring, and
      her hair tied in a bun (?), holds a brown necklace in her upraised right hand; Eunomia
      (labelled), seated 3/4-view to the left on a dolphin, her head turned profile to the right,
      wearing a himation around her lower body, over a belted, short-sleeved chiton, a single band
      necklace, a dot earring, and a sphendone, holds reins in her lowered right hand, and a profile
      shield (?) in her upraised left hand; Kymodoke (labelled), only the back of her hair, and her
      body below her waist, are preserved), seated 3/4-view to the left on a dolphin, wearing a
      himation around her lower body, over a chiton, holds her right hand to the left, at waist
      level, and rests her left hand on her lap, touching an unidentifiable curving object; a rocky
      cliff behind her.""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

