    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Griffin bird with outspread wings, knobs on head, tall pointed
      ears, and numerous details in added red and white. Blob rosettes as filling ornament. Rosettes
      on bottom, and top of mouth.</P>""" ;
