    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Boy in a red wreath runs to right, looks left, and rolls a hoop
      with a stick in his right hand. He carries on his left shoulder a tray of food including a
      mesomphalos loaf.</P><P>The base line is a labyrinthine
      meander.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

