<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/440ac8d7c9406550ad52eff4c0fc545bd3b0c43bc753cdbb1b01a207225cfbe1> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Summary"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Tondo: Love-making; a youth and a barbarian woman with scarification"@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/4414fa37d06006e71aad82665e539a2f0bfbf134ceaafd26c2af5e2537c78130> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>A: An inscription, <Foreign
      lang=Greek>[*T*O*N*A*Q]*E*N*E*Q*E*N*A*Q*L[*O]*N</Foreign>, along a black Aeolic (?)
      column on a one-stepped base, topped with a black plinth; on the plinth Eirene, standing
      3/4-view to the right, with her weight on her left leg, and her head in profile to the right,
      wearing a red (?) himation draped over her left shoulder, over a black chiton (?), raises her
      right hand, and cradles in her left arm a small, white boy, Ploutos, with black hair, wearing
      a black himation (?), who reaches his right hand up towards the head of Eirene, and holds the
      keras in his left hand; in the center, an archaistic Athena Promachos, standing profile to the
      right; an identical column (?).</P><P>B: A nude male figure, standing 3/4-view to
      the right, with his weight on his left leg, and his head turned profile to the right, holds
      both hands in front of his body; a small, white Nike with black wings, flying near profile to
      the right, wearing a black himation over a white chiton with a long kolpos, awarding a white
      garland to a nude wrestler, leaning profile to the right over another nude wrestler on the
      ground, 3/4-view to the left; a bearded (?), male figure, standing 3/4-view to the left,
      wearing a himation draped around his lower body and over his left shoulder, bends at the waist
      and leans down, and rest his right hand on his knee.""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/441d8df378a575245d81867287c214c47d3eda1cbd9f00d0baf34089c049d3db> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Summary"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "A hero on horseback approaches worshippers"@en ;
