      warrior) leaving home in a quadriga (four-horse chariot)"""@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/4989427f4d02105f05a5f808cc58c1a3f5cd8d9c3beab52a39daeea37e9e4edb> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Bibliographic references"@en ;
