<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/5b8c9622d69a2c876571a021a36096e5d82572d7a4c0455b751e6f3de174a82a> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Condition"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Broken and repaired, with some repainting of cracks and small missing pieces;
      e.g. parts of the himatia of the three women. The glaze is worn and scratched in many places,
      and there is discoloration from removal of incrustation. Large areas of the back and sides
      misfired a reddish color due to thinly applied slip.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435429> .

