<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/606121ddefb2a8330e689cd18351151df8be30e24370f26cbedf50f57ad15368> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Summary"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Head and shoulder of a woman facing right"@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/606e98d22e241c13290e2501c546cf37974428a764f294bcd4b15e934cd805da> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Herakles, striding right, wearing his lion skin, attacks an
      Amazon. His quiver hangs from his back held by a white strap. His left hand (hidden) clutches
      the Amazon and his right holds his club. The Amazon has fallen to her left knee and turns her
      head to the right with a spear in her right hand. She bears a Theban shield (device: white
      snake) on her left arm. She wears a tunic and an Attic helmet with a stilted crest. On either
      side, armored Greeks slay two other Amazons. At left, a Greek warrior wears a stilted helmet
      with a cross-bandolier on chest. He plunges his sword into an Amazon who lies flat on the
      ground. The Amazon wears a short chiton and Scythian hat. At right, a Greek warrior in a
      Corinthian helmet wears a tunic, and his sword hangs in a white baldric. He holds a red-rimmed
      shield (device: white dots and circle) on his left arm. With his sword in his right hand he
      stabs an Amazon who falls to her left knee. She wears a short belted chiton and a Scythian
      cap. She holds an ax in her left hand. The object at her hip may be a quiver. All three
      Amazons wear greaves.</P><P>On the shoulder are lotus buds. Simple black tongues
      appear below the neck. A red stripe runs around the top of the mouth. Red and reserved bands
      are below scene. There is a net pattern above the scene.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/6077929ed3abce18833c967b09f8adfb23f99ba8101341ccba1bce383ac7b9da> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
