<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/61496d1120e472aedb42cf83b52c0b55e79efb0d63faaaa836eb1ec85f672aba> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Bibliographic references"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<bibl>LIMC</bibl>, 7.56 s.v. Opora no. 3, pl. 44 (C. Weiss), 503 s.v.
      Pothos no. 28 (E. Simon), 63 s.v. Oreias no. 1, pl. 49 (A. Kossatz-Deissmann), 761 s.v.
      Sikinnis, Sikinnos no. 4 (A. Kossatz-Deissmann); <bibl>Shapiro 1993</bibl>, 68,
      119, 122, 235 no. 22, figs. 22, 71; <bibl>Kossatz-Deissmann 1991</bibl>, passim;
      <bibl>LIMC</bibl>, 5.426 s.v. Himeros no. 17 (A. Hermary);
      <bibl>Add2</bibl>, 340; <bibl>Boardman 1989a</bibl>, fig. 310;
      <bibl>LIMC</bibl>, 4.47 s.v. Eudaimonia 2 no. 1 (A. Kossatz-Deissmann), 48 s.v.
      Eudia 2 no. 2 (A. Kossatz-Deissmann); <bibl>LIMC</bibl>, 3.457 s.v. Dionysos no.
      372, pl. 339 (D. Gasparri); <bibl>McPhee 1973</bibl>, 53 no. 1, pls. 15-16;
      <bibl>Para</bibl>, 460; <bibl>Sichtermann 1966, 20-21 K10 pls. 10, 12,
      17</bibl>; <bibl>Hamdorf 1964</bibl> 110 no. 432a; <bibl>Hibbs
      1961</bibl> 60, fig. 66; <bibl>Papadaki 1960</bibl> 133-34;
      <bibl>Beazley 1947, 75</bibl>; <bibl>Frnkel 1912, 53, 69, 98-99 no.
      b</bibl>; <bibl>FR</bibl> 2.328-29 fig. 107; G.E. Rizzo, "Vasi Greci della
      Sicilia. Parte I. Cratere di Camarina," <hi rend="ital">MonAnt</hi> 14 (1904)
      34-39, figs. 12-15; <bibl>Roscher</bibl>, 3.2 (1897-1909) 2118 s.v.
      Personifikationen (L. Deubner) fig. 8; <bibl>Roscher</bibl>, 2.2 (1894-1897) 2445
      s.v. Marsyas (H. Jessen); H. Heydemann, "Satyr und Bakchennamen," <hi
      rend="ital">HallWPr</hi> 1880, pl. 1; <hi rend="ital">CIG</hi> 8380;
