<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/64545a0518065b0f0729c788a93ccb0d3a3496fade3f29c26f8efac6bdfdab42> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Child riding a stag. The group moves to the right. The child is
      nude, with its flesh rendered in added white, its arms pudgy and infantile in form, decorated
      with white bracelets in relief on the right wrist and ankle. Its hair is brown, bound with a
      white fillet. Below the lip and in the field are white heart-shaped flowers; on either side
      are plants with leaves and white berries. Below the design is an egg-and-dart
      pattern.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

