    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Irregular firing has left the black glazed areas red in spots; see the left
      figure on side B and the third figure from the left on side A. The vase shows some wear and
      small gouges; the white paint on the diskos is particularly worn.</P>""" ;
