<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/6ec40526bf6da171c1a1422ee4cc41b4f19ff685ed6a6b72a71eda99f6385dd1> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Summary"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Side A: Arming<lb>Side B: Athletes and trainer"@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/6ec562124e14b2c47114a4691fa1e6be8fad7338ca12e8c20c8b97a52ef56c7b> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>A: An inscription, <Foreign
      lang=Greek>*A*R*X*W*N*K*A*L*L*I*M*H*D*H*S</Foreign>, along a tall black column on a
      single-stepped base, with a single white band below a white, Ionic capital, a white plinth,
      and a broader black plinth, on which stands a statue of Eirene, standing 3/4-view to the
      right, with her weight on her left leg, and her head turned profile to the right, raising her
      right hand, and cradling in her left arm a small white boy, Ploutos, wearing a black himation,
      and holding a white keras in his left hand; he reaches his right hand towards Eirene; an
      archaistic Athena Promachos standing profile to the right; an inscription, <Foreign
      lang=Greek>*T*O*N*A*Q*E*N*E*Q*E*N*A*Q*L*O*N</Foreign>, along a column with statue
      group identical to that on the left.</P><P>B: A bearded male figure, standing
      3/4-view to the right, wearing a white olive wreath, a himation wrapped around his lower body,
      draped over his left shoulder and bunched in his left arm, obscuring his left hand, which he
      rests on his hip, holds a white/gold grain stalk diagonally in his left hand, lowered by his
      side; two nude wrestlers, still standing, both with short-cropped hair, one with his arms
      wrapped around the chest of the other; another nude male figure (the ephedros) with short
      hair, with his weight on his left leg, standing profile to the left, his hands
      clenched.""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/6ec7286802968c770998931bf32031439745358cb12b91484af8763f5694f798> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
