<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/72db1bf4b1ce64cd177ede06619e455dee98dd0117c155243e55ae259b890728> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Summary"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Charioteer standing in chariot with team of horses"@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/72e80ead39e7efd9fe862fae04db4b76541a3588ec1cdfa8acbc7529a744e8fa> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Geometric with horses and birds.</P><P><hi
      rend="ital">Side A:</hi> Three metopes are filled with animals and separated from
      each other by vertical and criss-cross lines. In the left panel a horse faces right with a
      goose under him. In the right panel a similar horse and goose face left. They seem to be
      tethered to feed boxes, fixed to the stall walls. Both have field decoration of dotted
      rosettes and zigzags. In the center two dancing birds (Coldstream: cock and hen) with hatched
      bodies are confronted. The field decoration consists of cross-hatched inverted triangles and
      dotted rosettes.</P><P><hi rend="ital">Side B:</hi> Three metopes,
      similarly filled with animals, are separated from each other by vertical lines and bands of
      cross-hatching. The left and right panels are the same as on A. The central panel has a broad
      heavy vertical meander pattern.</P><P>Light and dark are well-balanced on this
      vase with the upper half of body and foot predominantly light. The top of the rim is organized
      by groups of short strokes, five on each side. The handles are decorated with horizontal
      stripes in black on buff. Below the main design, there is horizontal linear decoration. The
      lower body and lower foot are black; and at the junction of foot and body, there are rays on
      the upper foot in black on buff.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/72fdf557e47840174dd1f0ebdd7decf5d537d3584964ce773d96c2a08e48da7f> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Condition"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>The vase is in very good condition. There is some chipping on the surface, and
      some of the paint has worn away.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435429> .

