      Bronze Age</hi> (Iowa City: Univ. of Iowa Press, 1987): 148, 149.</bibl>;
      <bibl>Williams 1985, 11</bibl></P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026497> .

