    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Flaked red and black glaze retouched, especially on the foot. A small fault on
      side A, to the left of the boar's eye, and a second one on the chest of the panther below the
      boar have been replastered and repainted.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435429> .

