      (1980) 127, 129 ns. 28-29, 134; <bibl>Ohly-Dumm 1975, 64, pl. 29</bibl>;
      <bibl>Froning 1971</bibl>, 17; <bibl>Para</bibl>, 443; R. Lullies,
      <hi rend="ital">CVA Mnchen</hi> 5 (1961) 38, pls. 247.2, 249.3-4, 251.1-2, 255.4
      (with previous bibliography); F. Winter, <hi rend="ital">Die jngeren attischen Vasen und
      ihr Verhltnis zur grossen Kunst</hi> (Berlin 1885) 22, 65, fig. 9, no. 19; A. Milchhfer,
      ""Bacchische Siegesfeier,"" <hi rend="ital">AZ</hi> 38 (1880) 183.""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026497> .

