<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/9d5937bccc9e35c1110b4e5199bcc085f2cbdacb7d1c9e9e7ee3c1e1b4fbcdd2> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Summary"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Pyxis with four plastically modeled horses decorating the lid"@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/9d6f5d5146a5ec6df6f0f4beadd1bc94d3ebdd91f74eff526c80636247507581> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """A (upper level): A female charioteer emerges from behind a hill (her
      feet obscured), standing in the chariot box 3/4-view to the right (labelled), driving a
      quadriga, wearing a belted, sleeveless chiton with patterned yoke, long curly dark hair in a
      pony tail, a red taenia (?), white dot earrings, a white necklace, two white bands on each
      wrist, bends her right arm at waist level, and holds reins and whip in her left hand, advanced
      to the right; Eris (labelled), standing frontal, with her head profile to the right, weight on
      her left leg, her right leg relaxed, wearing a belted, long sleeved, oriental tunic, belted
      over a chiton, a stephane with three white rays, a white bead necklace, a short, high pony
      tail, rests her right hand on her hip, and lowers her left hand at her side, bending her left
      arm slightly; Themis (labelled), standing 3/4-view to the left, wearing a double-belted,
      short-sleeved chiton with shoulder straps and a short overfold, white dot earrings, a rayed
      ovolo taenia over rolled hair, and a white bead necklace, rests her right hand on the left
      shoulder of Eris, and her left hand on her hip; another quadriga profile to the left (only
      ears and forehead of foremost horse, and the rear of the two latter horses remain), emerging
      from behind a hill, driven by a winged woman standing frontal in a chariot box (neck and head
      missing), wearing a peplos belted over a long overfold, two white bands on each wrist, holds
      the reins in her right hand, bent to the left, at waist level, with her left arm lowered at
      her side; bearded Zeus standing near profile to the left, wearing a patterned, bordered
      himation, draped around his waist and over his left shoulder, a white/yellow taenia, olive
      wreath, his left arm enveloped in his himation, leans on his straightened left leg, his right
      leg advanced slightly, lowers his right hand at his side, holding a scepter with a floral
      finial.""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/9d7d38fb18bb038919befb54069ccedf2de346c1de3b6d8c390aef1b44678780> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """Eutychia (labelled), standing 3/4-view to the right, with her weight on
      her left leg, wearing a belted, sleeveless chiton, a beaded (?) necklace, bead earrings, a
      high pony tail, holds a beaded necklace in her lowered right hand, and holds a footed box in
      her bent left arm; she slightly obscures a bed (?) emerging to her right; a winged, white
      (with red wings), nude Himeros (labelled), standing 3/4-view to the right, with his weight on
      his left leg, and his right leg relaxed, holds a beaded necklace in his lowered right hand,
      and extends an olive (?) wreath to the right, with his left hand; Aphrodite, seated 3/4-view
      to the left, wearing a belted, sleeved chiton with shoulder bands, a himation over her legs,
      and a sphendone, rests her left hand at her side, and holds her right hand in front of her
      face; Eros (?), standing 3/4-view to the right, holds olive branches (all but the top of the
      torso and wings are missing); Makaria (labelled), standing 3/4-view to the left, wearing a
      belted peplos, and a long pony tail, holds a long necklace (or branch of fruit?) between her
      upraised right hand (held in front of her mouth) and her lowered left
      hand.""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/9d8e60b9626a9971a6f2be7374a6b5257fe7147ccac826fd75917a74a2c5dcbb> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
