      man with youths"""@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/a9eaf5bb969afa1b317ebac6a7b03dc829ce516872265456df918640a187a312> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
