    rdfs:label "Summary"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """Death of Aigisthos<lb>Side A: Orestes, Aigisthos, Chrysothemis<lb>Side B:
      Clytemnestra, Talthybios. "Ghost" image below"""@en ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300080102> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/aff1fd081d89176095a5432148d7ca53323d197243a1343ef5122b637d55cdb9> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>At center is Hector's quadriga facing front. The charioteer,
      Kebrione, named in inscription, faces right. He wears a long chiton and holds the reins. The
      two inner horses face each other, the outer ones look away. They have incised tails and
      decorative breast bands. Hector stands to the left looking on at the central scene. He holds a
      spear in his right hand. The bearded hero of Troy wears a fillet in his long hair and is
      dressed soberly in a long black chiton and himation in added red. Behind him a nude soldier
      stands ready, holding a shield on his left arm and grasping a spear. He wears only a helmet.
      On the right of center Glaukos, named, stands looking left. He, too, wears a long chiton and
      himation in added red. He holds his spear with his left hand. At the far right is another man
      at arms, helmeted and carrying a shield and spear, he faces left. There are lotus as filling
      ornaments growing up from the ground line. Below the main design is a frieze of intertwined
      lotuses in red and black. The inscriptions naming the central figures are painted in
      red.<foreign lang="Greek">*E*K*T*O*R</foreign>, <foreign
      lang="Greek">*K*E*B*R*I*O*N*E</foreign>, <foreign
      lang="Greek">[*G]*L*A*U*K*O*S</foreign>.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/aff27dc7c8e8bbdeeade3fdd242cd4194fa4cabd03872f22bf3e294cb3c8806d> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Bibliographic references"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "<bibl>Stais 1907, 237 (ill.)</bibl>" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026497> .

