    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>The vessel is in good condition, except for a few areas where the glaze is
      beginning to flake off. Hussong (p. 22) suggests that the vase was already too dry when the
      glaze was applied, preventing a better bond.</P>""" ;
