      Hlscher, CVA Wrzburg, Martin von Wagner Museum 2 (1980) 13-16 figs.4-5, pls. 5, 6.1-2 (with
      earlier bibliography); T.B.L. Webster, "Tondo Composition in Greek Art," <hi
      rend="ital">JHS</hi> 59 (1939) 118-19, fig. 5""" ;
