<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/c63043ace4c0551df5c1e061b30ea65272cc2e229558638d71563940e4cec765> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>A quadriga half-turned to the left carries a warrior with
      high-crested helmet and shield. The shield has a device three white pellets. The quadriga is
      shown in three-quarter view as it turns. The warrior is pursuing another who retreats to the
      left, looking back. He is fully armed with a chlamys over his shoulders and a shield. His
      shield device is a bull's head. In the field there are imitation
      inscriptions.</P><P>The design is in black on a drab ground with added red. Above
      the design there are palmettes. On either side of the vase are
      ears.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/c635da8e563f42fbface72bda613acb3ae75cc6bc492f1cf759185431a5d4893> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Bibliographic references"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "<P>Pedley 1971.</P>" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026497> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/c636b1e08ff1884591c478a871b37d2f3c2df14ef41eeadb3b1176ddcbbf43c3> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Man and woman at a tomb. A man and woman stand on either side
      of a tomb. The focus of the scene is the tomb itself, which is painted in a more careful
      manner than are the figures. It sits in front of a tymbos resting on a low platform, and
      consists of a tall stele set on a high base of unusual structure. The high base ends in six
      'steps' set on top of a narrow entablature decorated with a zig-zag pattern. Both the tomb and
      tymbos are painted in secondary white. Ribbons originally hung around the monument but have
      faded, as has the painted decoration. The woman stands on the left holding out a fillet in
      both hands, ready to hang it on the tomb. She is dressed in a chiton with an overfold, and
      wears her hair pulled back in a simple style. The bearded man on the right leans on his stick,
      wearing a long chiton over which is wrapped a red mantle. His arms are folded and hidden under
      his clothes. Both figures are barefoot.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/c6397c0a3741202591ea24aaeac70e24d4434dd38d9e2fadff942afa9503d835> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
