<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/cad20e537394d3cc8d493e093466a14f7f0120c92db02ab45595c4aa035eca96> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>Herakles fights three Amazons, one to left, two to right. The
      Amazon at left, running left and turning back to right, wears a stilted helmet, tunic and
      cuirass. Her shield has a red rim and white dots as a device. Herakles, facing right, wears a
      tunic and lion skin, and wields a sword (or club?). The kneeling Amazon to the right of
      Herakles wears a stilted helmet, tunic and cloak. Her shield has a red rim and white dots as a
      device. The Amazon at right moves to left and wears a stilted helmet, cloak and tunic, and
      carries a shield with a white tripod as a device.</P><P>At the mouth is a
      checkerboard pattern, with a row of dots below, a band of lotus buds, and a meander pattern
      above scene. A red band runs around the lower body at the base of the
      scene.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

