<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/d559779a1f29aaa16d4d4cff19acabf4457629a0db89e4fdb2af25ff75d8d6b0> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P><hi rend="ital">Interior:</hi> An athlete with
      frontal face stands over a louter or laver (with tongue pattern on the base) holding a sponge
      (?) in his hands. Dilute glaze is used to articulate some of the musculature. At the left, his
      staff rests against the wall along with a strigil with duck head finial and an aryballos tied
      with added red. Sandals hang on the wall at the right. The tondo ornament is a broken meander
      running left.</P><P><hi rend="ital">Side A:</hi> An athlete seen from
      the back scrapes himself with a strigil. At the left, an aryballos tied with added purple and
      a sponge (?) hang on the wall. To the right, a staff rests against the wall and a vessel is
      probably lifted by the athlete intending to fill a laver. A strigil and sandals with added
      purple straps hang on the wall above another athlete holding out a strigil in his hand.
      Jumping weights (halteres) appear in the background near a staff.</P><P><hi
      rend="ital">Side B:</hi> A staff rests on the wall to the left of an athlete in
      three-quarter back view scraping himself with a strigil, He wears an added purple fillet and
      bracelet. An aryballos and sponge hang on the wall and another athlete in back view, wearing
      an added purple fillet and anklet, draws a vessel of water from a well with a rope. A third
      athlete in three-quarter back view scrapes himself with a strigil. His aryballos tied with
      added purple and a sponge hang on the wall along with his sandals with added purple straps. A
      staff closes the scene.</P><P>The artist favors varied poses for his figures,
      especially the twisted back view with distinctive broken shoulder blades (<bibl>Boardman
      1985b, 134</bibl>).""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

