      1966): 98, no. 48, pl. XXX, 2a-d</bibl>; <bibl>T. Dunbabin and M. Robertson "Some
      Protocorinthian Vase-Painters" <hi rend="ital">BSA</hi> 48 (1953):
      179</bibl></P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026497> .

