<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/d706575fef4fe10d1ed153348c7f1d96e79f322149503b3010100ccb8e4d2a73> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P><hi rend="head">Interior:</hi> In the center is the
      black omphalos or boss. Around this is a frieze of four animals, alternating between two goats
      and two panthers. In the field are dots and small, incised rosettes. There is a copious use of
      incised lines for details. The design is rendered in black only. The exterior is
      undecorated.</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/d708cb2409185969238d4953306b93af9eed193014b47957ff5f35b6d26b5adc> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
