<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/dae2ea2dc614958d3ff9770273e59521cde3b584f9541c609598e06b079d83df> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """The extant fragments depict, on side A, three herms, the center one
      shown frontally, with the others turned profile towards it; on side B, a girl, wearing a
      short-sleeved chiton with a long overfold, advancing profile to the right, holding a
      sacrificial basket on her head, while a nude youth, behind her (shown in 3/4-view to the left)
      reaches down to a hydria.""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/daf1d6a483fb6518544ccb64b90c7efc5dc33898fdd8673a1bc22f89a7efbc22> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Iconographic description"@en ;
    crm:P190_has_symbolic_content """<P>The vessel has a deep bowl on an off-set ring foot, and broad
      vertical ring handles, each having sharp projections across the top and bottom. The rim is
      decorated with a band of black paint. Around the middle of the bowl are three bands of black
      paint (this is the groundline for the figures on Side A), and around the bottom of the bowl is
      a molded band.</P><P><hi rend="ital">Side A</hi>: A woman is shown
      offering a cup to a squatting man. Behind the cup are vine branches. To the left of the woman
      is a loom with weights at the end of its strings. Probably this portrays Circe giving the
      magic potion to Odysseus (<bibl n="Hom. Od. 10.315-322">Hom. Od.
      10.315-322</bibl>), but this scene is done in a grotesque style. Homer mentions the loom
      in connection with the story.</P><P><hi rend="ital">Side B</hi>: Just
      below the painted band on the rim is a vine with four bunches of grapes.</P><P>The
      "Kaberieion style" of Boeotian vase painting (so called because of their popularity at a
      sanctuary near Thebes) might reflect comic theatrical performances done at the sanctuary
      (Buitron, 79).</P>""" ;
    crm:P2_has_type <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435430> .

<https://aa.perseus.org/id/text/daf3a08062701a86a164ca2b74974942c8c3057419f97fbe3244af8ae5664f7e> a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
